hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"57","Rabbi’ghfir lī, Rabbi’ghfir lī. ¤--------------------------------- ¤ Lord, forgive me. My Lord, forgive me."
"58","Allāhumma’ghfir lī, war’ḥamnī, wahdinī, wajburnī, wa `āfinī, warzuqnī, warfa`nī. ¤--------------------------------- ¤ O Allah forgive me, have mercy on me, guide me, support me, protect me, provide for me, and elevate me."
